{
  "slug": "azure-sql-developer",
  "name": "Azure Sql Developer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Agent skills for Azure SQL Developer, the Azure SQL Database engine running locally in a container. Teaches your agent to run the engine, connect, migrate, scaffold, build RAG, wire CI, and go local-to-cloud, using the real Private Preview image instead of the SQL Server image.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **17 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (17): `azuresql-db-auth` (Connects an app to the Azure SQL Database container securely, with a least-privilege database user instead of the…), `azuresql-db-ci` (Runs integration tests against the Azure SQL Database container (Private Preview, local engine) in CI), `azuresql-db-connections` (Makes an app's database connections reliable against the local Azure SQL Database container (Private Preview) and, unchanged, against…), `azuresql-db-container` (Runs the Azure SQL Database container (the Azure SQL Database engine) locally (Private Preview): the real PaaS engine…), `azuresql-db-dab` (Stands up an instant no-code REST + GraphQL API over the local Azure SQL Database container using Microsoft…), `azuresql-db-faq` (Answers questions about what the Azure SQL Database container (Private Preview) can and cannot do, and WHY it…), `azuresql-db-feedback` (Reports a bug or files feedback about the azuresql-db-* agent skills themselves, or about the Azure SQL Database…), `azuresql-db-from-sql-server` (Migrates a local SQL Server setup to the Azure SQL Database container for Azure-faithful local development), and 9 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install azure-sql-developer@claude-plugins-official` from `microsoft/azure-sql-database-container`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
  "sourceType": "community",
